  (text "MCU STM32G031G8U6\n- I2C1 (PB6/PB7) 100kHz: BQ25713 0x6B, BQ40Z50 0x0B, TPS55289 0x74, TPS25750 0x20.\n- SW2 VOUT SELECT 4 bit (DIP_V0..V3, aktif-low) -> tabel 16 preset di firmware.\n- SW3 APPLY: tegangan baru diterapkan hanya setelah tombol ditekan.\n- Pin 18/19 dipakai sebagai PA9/PA10 (default, tanpa remap).\n- PC15, PB8 cadangan." (at 230 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "69e76992-f70b-5d77-bb7b-ce6627861c2c")
  )
